      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154ad6f188d558c911db57f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なるほど…興味深いですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0643b2768379e81277d59c699380c4917b839b6513f672dc9abbfa769bb4d4d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f721966dbecea1d1e3220a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着崩れなどしていないでしょうか…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed07688e227b23f2f13648e2396b5fcbd6575ed9e8f1b3edcbc7aa4aa2be9d1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1275f49be78040cb4f00d465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85c8a6b2f0abbf065d0569dfd8a4d25d15eb8c8f4eaab1e7871c29f6ec129094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:505ea6463a6eb89c27058ffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日の予定を机に置いております。\r\nあ、机上に資料が散乱していました\r\nので、用件ごとに分けておきました",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8ec5a3bf464dc2c78ca5e74e26812372d9fe58f90ad5309b312ea91548c6275",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c43bc9a7d628a574a07d844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…トレーナーさんの昼食の傾向は\r\n炭水化物に偏っていました。朝食は\r\n野菜を中心にしてみるとよいかと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0e4346f319fa06da22f6d1f0b36b70c34e3eae8861b13fcd971feacd5df669",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb4bf70dcddba4348128729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼休みは教室で仮眠をとろうかと。\r\n休む時は休む…円滑に予定をこなす\r\nにはメリハリが大切ですので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "736f312f3a210c25ef1607737bb1766757d57c131227afc40d6a33c55f596374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20bd195bbeef40b4f0aa2d93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また失敗しました…。コツをつかむ\r\nどころかボロボロこぼれてしまう…\r\n難しいですね、ハンバーガーは…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4507ab31d57846b6ae32064350e0ad771e4e1cf5ddd6a6a351ed0b0998c8f74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4c14579653ef0e0cffec35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目の下にクマが…睡眠不足は集中、\r\n免疫、思考力を低下させます。仮眠\r\nをとられては？私が起こしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee8edb44255378f68e70624d969cb1990bed47516ea4054ff6c14598299e22dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409d464c14ac5cb2c2f3a097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遅くまで残られてお疲れでしょう。\r\n疲労回復には糖分です。\r\nチョコレートでもいかがですか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1215474e0bf30f47c3081d1d4a4a8fdb96cd9ed0a570e46c3a78c65f0babc5c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6fe34664897b98b522c2c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は始まりの季節。私の予定も\r\n全て作成済みです。全体計画の他に\r\nレース、行事などタスク毎のものも",
      "source_fingerprint": "d542faa70b56c194a645dcfe95458956ca0b450e5ad8f4f6b5f53ad6285b44db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b203fbf6aced85aec22839c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏は水分に加え、ミネラルも必須。\r\nスポーツ飲料もいいですが塩分を\r\n豊富に含む梅干しもおすすめです",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d32717c2562d31f3f6839602c4728496c5d8704001b14c571c4de8d630b6676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:937eaab7ec7d4f49b9fcb9d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は催し物が多い季節。総務委員\r\nとして、生徒と学園の間に入り、\r\nスムーズな運営に努めなければ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560026c108fae60665e0dfd0731979907f3fcc094e3641b33826222b1a1657dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0dce19fceb2d70c059dffc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬のマラソン、おすすめですよ。\r\n私は冷たい空気で頭が冴えるのが\r\n心地よく。健康にもいいですしね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63f598c664dd918bfd9b9607b8759bb7830e9fc0d78d1bc6d579fe78380f771f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8a945849a125d14347d28e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン、です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4928b89820dcd257934f26864c868bf6be793128610f5fdcf4bc15a143348f28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:522df23c205b0a3a28a816f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャさんは心が読めるのでは？\r\nあの気づかい力はそうとしか…いえ\r\nそれとも…私がわかりやすい…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7adf29a2c84d304a205a2b187237b49abee6924b92a329831093f01dd9f19f96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2128392913fc5d85527cd27f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『ターボはターボ』\r\n…実に、真理をついた発言です。\r\nターボさんから学ぶことは多い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8e59afdd0807b42552095873eb0086b3ab6ac34dfe4ee75150989ab7c197a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91ba23e345b8f06506866d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "父の影響で工具の扱いは得意です。\r\nボルトを回す際は最適な大きさの\r\nレンチをすぐに提供いたしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6955dbeade1cd0b269c8e239efa092f3531c2d162e64a2c7b84fd52ec2061266",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432e995a42e299e1c313120a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タンホイザさんの前向きさには誰も\r\nが救われています。トラブル時さえ\r\nその慌てぶりで笑顔にしてくれます",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a61a481a3d326b7c00c90fd36c7de2858f87804aa504b4691382977a3d05911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e957faf361623d4f4fbdb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の眠りはとても静かだそうです。\r\n…静かすぎて、マックイーンさんに\r\n呼吸を確認されたこともありました",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8dd01225682cf1400a866469c3fd7f79628e260fdec1b27ead035984db63811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496a783b717ef4442c379e7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧なパフォーマンスを提供する。\r\nそれが応援してくれる方々への\r\n何よりの礼になると思うのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "341d671b6cb196c6debe4ca32a759743dd16864e6be467acca418d7b9b9fa105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec485a1e3fcfa145c209799f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "統一衣装で見せる息の合った動きも\r\nライブに求められるもの。常に\r\n全体へ意識を配っておかなければ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b92e939c7ff4231c35821b97d471bf27f46dd46eec6ac6946c0b84172ffc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cf5542c1ba43074473d4c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体にフィットして、どんな動きを\r\nしても支障がない。スマートで\r\n機能的な勝負服を追究したのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4d1e731b943c42405f23a7c48cbdf8121758b0d97022a1e49acf5ff8958119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3ce2409990092db7b173c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝負服を着ていると気力が満ちて\r\nくる気がします。自然と胸を張って\r\nしまうような…高揚を覚えるのです",
      "source_fingerprint": "933f112332fcee8cf4ddbec6e96deffdc031f46b68c792d4683b8d90a7f3df0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c4714eed6fd9a0a9eaedb0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かっとばせー！マックイーンさんの\r\n知人の誘いで野球観戦に行くのです\r\nそれで、朝練しながら応援練習を…",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e522dc38e642617d05c10bddb3a99c47df73df673b06495163af63e7ac5255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6199fb1af4bab8ba6fecbae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボさんの昼食は栄養が偏り\r\nすぎていて…。絵本は通用しなく\r\nなってきましたし…次は劇…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "490b80e0977d0422238a62326d797317543526c24a4a008d9933efad047612d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe3df0d79dff9f4e8d0015e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜食…でしたら、おかゆなど消化の\r\nよい物がいいかと。塩分は控えめで\r\n卵を溶いて入れるとなおよいですね",
      "source_fingerprint": "0933ae95be1fbd568a7b56f5f1ff6ead9404a87fe4d351aef6b1a026cd42a722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9725bbc55530bdff87b7e797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桜の花弁は美しい…ですが！地面に\r\n落ちるとスリップ事故の危険性が。\r\n重々、お気をつけくださいね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be372e2e493881ca7ed7382c61764b53c57acd61d1ac4265c19ad230f0afe446",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8b52b8d0dcd78e0423cfb61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "陽射し対策にサングラスを購入した\r\nのですが…なぜでしょう、胡散臭い\r\n古物商のように見えてしまい…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9733c4814ff77d66de429a286ea344f77474d2cbbdac7736ba3ebfdbb138ebe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5251c89af9b38fb4bdb64336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉の中のサイクリングはいいもの\r\nです。何より秋は同志が多い。景色\r\nの情報交換も楽しみのひとつです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3db4b53992a075f4dcfa2f822022906cc5fcd1fc522a46703fe2569e65398e59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2efc94ddd75ca33a48b762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温かい物を食べたくなりますね。\r\n湯気でメガネがよく曇るので、\r\nそこは少々困ってしまうのですが…",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d176ba5c313c2702ed2591c0b7ada9373d461d53d9d3ba84fd10233b28d179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8943905e2026eb418aa1d04a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日の予定に向けた準備は\r\n整えています。必要でしたら\r\n予定表の確認を再度行いますか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34362ef01e26f215c36630681d96bd1836f67b6fb77a3d77186eac26c58a3bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15eacf2f6dee419bb2066a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参ります",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0d2fe363da0315fead48cf8313f1843abe8ed0a62c4360ef820f9f646562bf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de7f3ec961f7d91e3c8b39b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウォーミングアップは\r\n済ませておきました。\r\nいつでもどうぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f35d7bc820c91a4481ba580b2f849fbb9d850bba51ffabf5575ad085c5e2002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a99a5df0b6a9fb824624cb74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万全を期して臨みます。…が、それ\r\nでも不足ならば遠慮せずなんなりと\r\nご指摘ください。対応いたします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be73bbd192024172deebfb517bc777412b092dd492cbd48f3b3c35c2060712f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0da1581085296710525016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鉄は熱され何度も打たれ、\r\n強くなるものです。私も…\r\n鉄のように、鍛えていきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b94a474aaeae331381770c1b8ff195929ea620bf6b24146b8574581f61e95de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ad57eb9a75d72c802652ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の意見も柔軟に取り入れて\r\nいただき、感謝しています。\r\n相乗効果…素敵な言葉ですよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "732a6d3768de026423e95cef0acf30fc42923e7a4ee43753744f9de4a46623b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ebb885fae65c4665462763a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "予定通りにいかない事もあります。\r\nその度に貴方の信頼に支えられて、\r\n計画を組み直す意欲が湧くのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a5389724804814aa6637148728bc35f3bffbd740620ecf10788b70a0042b39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ae6d4cd0d94ca1772132c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方とならば、長く強く走って\r\n行ける…。そう思うのです。経験と\r\n信頼から導き出した絶対の答えです",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb4c299251d23d1777764c90b15c0f33d64c1f4b989f7ce8b1fd2bac42a8d09d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a06a09d8759a39cf9b93739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日焼け止めクリームの塗り忘れは、\r\n皮膚の炎症などを引き起こします。\r\nお忘れでしたら、お貸ししますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a9211e93de2913a81010888ee82845f79a31756e6e01ae46f045778c72a97e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f474e6642d71f873447c19e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "長く、熱く…そして、輝かしい道のりでした。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3ba71d128902b1b2d322046db9555294e72951a70f7ff48a0ce194900f447c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1f48fd2bc852124e14f1ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共に歩めたこと…記憶にとどめ続けます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c92d578009158f0d1996c482e1744ee59b6f7be4c8b141e3e98543412834555",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5aeea1752c2594e9abf6668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "経験が力となる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b10d903b43cb5a3a1d3bfe8868a38859d717a276671340cd3ec3e5bcfe088c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd2717f97dbf2a198d646b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私にはまだ\r\nこのような可能性が…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e06c633f0d9ead8d29ab142b614e961db4d601c35fd5438f5527614518dca0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fcfeb29dae76e79245b733b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イクノディクタスです。お見知りおきを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76ca3ff271c9eed6a671b22c3286e1f9170a804a487ee87efac7d5bd191c966",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b683db3fe4d72acbb6e5d7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "敬请期待更加周全的支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba79aa1252954652073ee62bffb7bab526b0bb0a4e95a2f60e4c5396bded0cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0448097d574ccfbbf24a26db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会将一切准备得万无一失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d322f5ff32166f98a07de0b3193e20c479f6ee9796f56196a18d8ada88c10c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9657f0ce2b66ad6e78cad902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c53609f9c7bbd880c4bc8096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到遇见你我才发现，\r\n原来我可以自由奔跑啊……\r\n爆速领头果然是最赞的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b2dadeebefa6fb28dd2de38fe2ebd0659c59f515920fe08dcb664c889f5e87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f191e6d8c0423b8dd6f951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるねーっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42d0837ca8e3319c418edb0f8a0a6f04f3fd1b202fff282bb8ba9ddcc55c652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c896f2f4b33dbfd3347bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec21c815184bd6427f4ef2d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随时欢迎找我商量～♪\r\n应该说是我自己\r\n想跟你聊天啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e061a56fc2bc161f0219296df338145d3a820e0b674f9c0f5823180de8911f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1280c72f3de3f3be49455041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说啊，我的训练员人选可不是\r\n随便谁都好啊……啊～刚刚那句\r\n不算数！实在太逊了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7b37456933a2ce4477471c48834d51a0951803c5c3117c25141fe63c4558f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ad8ed5b9244a66401caa7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年也要麻烦你多多关照了。\r\n……怎样？挺有模有样的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0916273019e2027d10aa7ee8a6890abc71e9271ea6ec35d853155f4bbe5234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f7ce9a36f6567e04196892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很～好，我要开吃巧克力啰！\r\n只要有阿尔丹介绍的这款洗面奶，\r\n想战痘轻轻松松～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a8518fcfaa61eabeee3cc95a9ed87ca6bf77f62d0f58d0fa3afccfffd2cdb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30209ceab8f59d3884f53196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么啦？看你坐立难安？\r\n……逗你的啦，今天是情人节对吧♪\r\n我也准备了给你的巧克力喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dfc4c1ea39bde45c88d29cf6694704764e8a851537eb7f4ab74b08932ee6677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c631b7094470dc0a35f961",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说牛郎与织女一年只能见一次面？\r\n啊～好想告诉他们！\r\n现代可以用LANE讲视讯电话啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "947144a325e253d8081a67c9f1fb0b9f89f90b79280dba1291a90fec500fd093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481b10ef03403b76a2e31c9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来扮德古拉，你扮被吸血的人！\r\n只要两人互相搭配，\r\n参加扮装活动就不会害羞了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "481413fbb15399400e5de80f4644b71db8a34c795d9928180dac4bb974b35fe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d5cdc40463513b1021ca88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在Umatter上看到\r\n「圣诞节停办公告」……奇怪？\r\n今年应该会照常举办吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1102d22a91b1102bd19ecd44572d7ca6e40b434827cefe72719188fcdcb53608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:694e13bf5c32a4e3b03c5b91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家专属的灯饰\r\n美得令人无法置信喔。\r\n我想让训练员也看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e69f93e72b75df4bbbf643e1a8fca04cfe06b206ed71274433b39f6f614315",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61cbe0ad2c48fca2a46ac391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，做得好～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73729de4c80d9c1e32d3622f497ed46317178ac40e5f42d07a17532e3493eecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d76b94679421d187df9243e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚生野来过啰。她说\r\n「年底了，我来打声招呼」。\r\n真有礼貌，她就是这点可爱～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06e49a32895e204be0f66e089b22f500106b005be6cd7118a7f685acd42fb20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0e497e4bca8f29bf28ece5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～♪\r\n我要去请大家都来\r\n一起祝你「生日快乐」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "278aa52befd7b9bc3ad38d5c1b08139540a7404a0d8d4310616e90a2734424cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce0e56a5f77734c3622da33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是一年只有一天的大日子呢！\r\n不只是你的大日子，对我来说也是！\r\n所以我特别空下今天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "849d4560eac79e5217405987c6f402e217013a8f13f27e8c56f200b81ae18afd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d17dab5420dbc5347b4d366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳神连传「生日快乐贴图」过来，\r\n完全不肯停耶！不是吧，\r\n至少让我回复啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7817ba845377aa1ec3e7753994b70fd324ed60ed2e5498c77eea559019b03d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
